Cell["\<\
Read gray magnetic space group 191 and inspect representative unitary and \
antiunitary records. Each record is {label, point matrix, translation, \
antiunitary flag}:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"4a77ee7e-efe2-4002-8840-de68a42833e3"],

